      "role": "user",
      "content": "8000mg?? wow thats massive. i'm a little nervous though because i was reading some medical stuff online saying that high doses of vitamin c can actually turn into oxalate and cause even more stones. especially since i already have them. are you sure it's safe to go that high? i don't want to make the stones bigger or worse.",
